            "review_title": "Review at Trung Nguyên Legend Café",
            "review_text": "WMike77\n366 contributions\n0\nNice relaxing cafe of the more expensive class\nJan 2025 • Family\nSince we are \"fans\" of this coffee brand, we made ourselves comfortable here in the early afternoon, when there were not many guests.\n\nLocated opposite Diamond Plaza.\n\nPrices are of course much more expensive, from 55,000, than at the many \"street cafes\", but here you can also get coffee specialties.\n\nTested the tiramisu here, but not what you know in Europe under it, not recommended; banana pancake and sandwich were delicious.\n\nService took a little longer, but in the very pleasant atmosphere and furnishings, a cozy break from the hustle and bustle of the streets can be spent.\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten January 5, 2025",
